noPhotos

# B+ -> anti-D_0*0 mu+ nu_mu (LLSW), anti-D_0*0 -> anti-D*0 pi+ pi- (PHSP)
# Non-resonant D(*)pipi l nu through a broad D** as in Belle II 129670000x.dec

Decay Upsilon(4S)
1.0  B+sig  B-sig  VSS;
Enddecay

Decay B+sig
1.0  anti-D_0*0  mu+  nu_mu   LLSW 0.68 -0.2 0.3;
Enddecay
CDecay B-sig

Decay anti-D_0*0
1.0  anti-D*0 pi+ pi-   PHSP;
Enddecay
CDecay D_0*0

End
